            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.11.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 11:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, at’ Uwo musi ni washika, hazoza ivyiyumviro mu mutima wawe, wīgīre imigabo y’ibibi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.49.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 49:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maz’ uzovuga, uti Hinge ndūge ntere igihugu c’imihana itubakiwe inzitiro z’amabuye, ngīre abibereye impore ata co binona, bose uko bangana baba ahatubakiwe inzitiro, ata n’imyugariro cank’ amarembo bagira; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ng’ uhasahure, uhanyage iminyago, ubangurire ukuboko kwawe ahāhoze ar’ imisaka hagasubira kubamw’ abantu, no ku bgoko bgākoranirijwe hamwe buvuye mu mahanga, bāmaze kwironkera amatungo n’ibintu, bakibera hagati mw isi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab’i Sheba n’ab’i Dedani n’abadandaza b’i Tarushishi n’abahambaye nk’ imigunza y’intambge baho bose, bazokubaza, bati Mbeg’ uzanywe no gusahura? Wakoranije ico gitero cawe kunyaga iminyago, no gutwara ifeza n’izahabu, no kwishorerera amasho no gutwara ibintu, no kunyaga iminyago myinshi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
